id=nib_stylus_unblock
name=Nib stylus unblock (HyperOS)
version=v3
versionCode=3
author=Nib contributors
description=For Nib (app.nib.notes) on HyperOS: exempts it from the stylus palm-rejection hold (MiuiStylusEventBlocker), so strokes start instantly, and lets the pen use the screen's full refresh rate (144 Hz) instead of HyperOS's fixed 120 Hz. Remove the module to undo.
